    corrected_body:=replace(replace(corrected_body,$catalog_original_marker$global_terminal_actual as materialized($catalog_original_marker$,$catalog_source_ctes$global_source_corrections_settings as materialized(select $source_corrections102${"patches":[{"table":"item","id":11937,"before":{"id":11937,"bulk":"","name":"Dragonclaw Scutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4742342761897748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"affixed to a shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:34.576952+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Requirements** You have the affixed shield [raised](link_action_19750); **Trigger** You would take damage of a type depending on the [talisman](link_trait_1544)’s [dragon](link_trait_2402) type.\n\n* * *\n\nThis decorative shield emblem contains the gilded claw of a [dragon](link_trait_2402) mounted in a setting of high-grade adamantine alloy. It protects against a damage type depending on the type of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw came from (see below). When you Activate the scutcheon, you and all of your carried, wielded, or worn items gain immunity to all damage of that type until the end of your next turn.\n\nIf you have a _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_, _[dragonscale cameo](link_item_11941)_, and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ attached to your items, and they all correspond to the same type of [dragon](link_trait_2402), you gain an extra benefit. When you Activate any of these [talismans](link_trait_1544), you gain the ability to cast an 8th-rank, DC 35 *[dragon breath](link_spell_6435)* focus spell as an innate spell once before the end of your next turn. Use the [dragon](link_trait_2402) type that matches the [talismans](link_trait_1544); you can Cast the Spell this way without spending a [Focus Point](link_trait_1856). Because each [talisman](link_trait_1544) disintegrates when used, you can’t get this benefit again until you’ve attached a replacement.\n\n* * *\n\n#### Dragon Damage Types\n\nThe _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_ and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ use a type of damage depending on what kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw or tooth came from. These items are typically made from the [dragons](link_trait_2402) in Monster Core, but your GM might introduce uncommon or rare versions made from other types of [dragons](link_trait_2402).\n\n| Dragon Type | Damage Type |\n\n| --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Conspirator or horned | [Poison](link_trait_1476) |\n\n| Diabolic | [Fire](link_trait_1542) |\n\n| Empyreal | [Spirit](link_trait_1556) |\n\n| Fortune | [Force](link_trait_1560) |\n\n| Mirage or omen | [Mental](link_trait_1448) |","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one claw from an adult or older dragon."},"after":{"id":11937,"bulk":"","name":"Dragonclaw Scutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4742342761897748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"affixed to a shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_s